    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gaarí taa gooín an kaahi nee hara'aya, tidá' ta boo/esa' ar ilakaahara baraá yaamuudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguú baabi'iihúng ni kuungií haniisi kiwa ala' deelo sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' wa/ameedá' muu munguaá hatlá' ngiwa sluufmiisi hhaamiisaak, gawaá tlom'aá tlede, nee gawaá gongoamawo, nee dír umuúqo gamuú xa'anoó loo/o naa/e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiteeri'ín kudaá ilahhooa fee/aak, nee tlaa/eedá' taa sihhtimís as kiwa sluufmiisi parhhamisaak. Slaqsi'ii'ín kudaá Ashera hhaamiisaak ar asla, nee slaqsi'ii'ín kudá' taa dakuút, umer'ín amór saáwí hhaamiisaak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Munguúhúng, mu adoodár inooínár sluufmisara'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tlawé' ay didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng i tsawaari baraá tla/ángw tlahhi'i sleémeero, as umuuwós kuwa xirfayeesa', nee dír hotaawós kawa tlehha', amoodá' an amór kuungá' ta keera'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee sleeme didae kuungá' ilahhooár da/a ti hanise', nee ilahhooarhúng ar murú ta tsu/i, nee ilahhooár gár wák baraá muruú mibaango nee qeemuhunge, nee ilahhooár al'axweesani, nee ilahhooár sla'aari, tidár duxúng sla'aari, ar barsuú hikwa nee oo bee/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoodae kuungá' an /ayiindá' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng wa ale, tari qwalala/á', kuungá' dinkwa nee múk marayhunge, as diihhooadá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, nura tsuúq.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Adoorí hám ta tlehhita' ma tleehhara', umuú heewo adoorós ar i slai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aga dati'iiká didá' tawa hungu/usa, nee baraá yaamuudá' ta ala', kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, nuy haniisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qoomár yaaér Yordani barnaxes aga waarahhé', nee tari hotá' baraá yaamaá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, i kuungá' i haniisi, nee qoomár burna hungu/uús, kuungá' mutunduwa dawitamiís nee wakuuserhúng sleémeero, tidá' kuungá' naa harwet, as kuungá' tawa hota' ar amohhooa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagáy didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, i tsawaari, asma umuuwós iwa didá' wa hooti, kuungá' tidá' sleémeero aníng nu baw ka didií hubá', ilahhooarhúng ar da/a, nee ilahhooarhúng ar muruú ta tsu/i, nee ilahhooár gár wák baraá muruú mibaango, nee qeemu nee ilahhooár al'axweesani tidá' handá' taa slaé' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i hanisaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoodae kuungá' an qwalala/á' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng wa aleeró. Kuungá' nee na/iihúng awa daaqaay nee awa dasuuwo, nee lawaalerhúng ar hhawaate nee ar /ameenaaro nee múk tlahhoo Laáwi, kudá' nee kuungá' alhootá'. Asma inooín dír i aaliya' ngi kon'aaká baraá tla/angwhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti harmagahhe', ilahhooár da/a ma tawo duxuumara' umuú dír taaqo sleeri'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ala aqo har didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tsawaár baraá tlahhoó wák wa ale baraá tlahhi'iihunge, diirí an didá' ta ilahhooár dá/tí hanisá', nee an didá' muruuduú hatlá' sleémeero kuwa tlehhita', kudá' naa kuungá' báw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala kuungá' tundu ila/anká hikwaahúng kiwa tsu/a' nee fu'unay'ín kiwa /aga', dír umuúqo kuungá' ta hota', adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, nura tsuúq, adoodá' tsuuqa kira ilaoté' dír AAKOÓ MUNGUHE. Muu sleémeero kudá' hhohhó', laqaá oo ta harmeetina, ta /ayin adoodá' fu'unaá tlaaqati, laqaá awa saargi kir /aa/ayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kár ala tseerér makayká' ma wahaamara', tseere aqo an yaamií ku'usá' adór ma'aay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muruuwí mu /ayaara' dír taqo hota'a, adór ilahhooarhúng ar gár wák baraá muruú mibaango ar balangwhúng, nee difaáirhúng, laqaá di/tahúng, laqaá barsuú hikwaahúng, laqaá oo bee/angwhúng, laqaá ilahhooarhúng ar al'axweesani, laqaá ilahhooarhúng ar sla'aari ar ta hanisa' ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' muruuwí sleémeero dír kuwa /aga' a dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, didá' inós i tsawaari. Kuungá' ta al/ayiindá' nee daaqayhúng nee dasuuhúng, sagadiyuuserhúng, nee lawaalerhúng ar hhawaate nee ar /ameenaaro, nee múk tlahhoó Laáwi kudá' baraá gixsaduuhúng wa hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tí inslawaak qooma sleémeero ar tawa hota' baraá yaamuuhúng kukae, hariímár múk Laáwi ma gunqareesara'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, bar digimuú yaamuuhúng nguwa doogi, adoodá' ngura al'axweés, kuungá' tari oé', ‹Fu'unaay i /ayaán,› asma kiwa sla'a', i qoón har qoomoó ta sla'a' kuwa /aga' ay dír ti axa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barnaxes didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng i tsawaari, dirhunge ka saaw, nee kuungá' hikwaahúng, laqaá bee/angwhúng kudá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nura tsuúq, iga tsu/é', adoodá' ngira hara'ayiím, i ya/aán fu'unaydá' kiwa /aga' umuúqo dír ti diria'a baraá yaamuhunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adór fu'unaá tlaaqati, laqaá awa saargi, kir /aa/aga', kuká' sleeme i adoodár /agá', tam hee ku hhoohhoó' laqaá bar kusameetín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala ti ló'wa harmagahhe', ló' tseere ma baloó /ayaara', asma tseere a slafiingw, gimsé' slafiingw mu baloó /ayaara' dinkwa nee fu'unaay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tseereerí ma /ayaara', ala yaamií ku'usaak adór ma'áy wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tseere ma /ayaara', asma bar aga /agi'iiká, adór hhoo' aga tlehhé' dír geeraá AAKOÓ Munguhe, nee diihhooa a sleerá', kuungá' nee na/iihunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala qeemuudá' hhohhó', kudá' ta hanmisa' nee ilahhooadár al'axweesanto, ki hubá' didá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa tsawaár. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' ilahhooár da/a an hanisá', fu'unaay nee tseereero gawaá kitangwduú ilahhooár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng kawa hanmaamisa'. Tseerér ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i an tsipipi'isá' gawaá kitangwduú ilahhooár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng, ala i ya/aán kuungá' fu'unaydá' kiwa /aga'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ti ló'wa harmagahhe' axweesantí naa bawi iialooeesé', as kuungá' diihhooa kawa sleera' dinkwa nee na/iihúng awa aluúwaá hardahá' ay alhhe'eesay wasle, asma kuungá' adoorihe adoodá' hhoo' aga tlehhé' dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhunge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
