          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Qoomár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng xoorduudá' birnga hhaamiís geeraahúng wa ale, kudá' kuungá' ta gusa', tari baraá yaamuuín wa hotá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí harmagahhaak, ma tawo dahaara' baraá tsaaxweeli, alaá kiwa gusé', mi eeharaara'. Miti dawitimisara' as kawa xu'utír wa sla'a' daanduú mungui'ine tawa kata', ‹Xoorduuká' adór munguii'ín ngir sluufmisiya' as atén adoodá' ngiwa tleehhaan sleeme.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúhúng mu adoorír firirimaara', asma umuú gár AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa aahhi inooín ngina dír munguii'íní tlehhiitiyé'. Tam inooín daaqay'ín nee dasuuine ngina da/a/ané' baraá asla as tawa ilahhooár da/a/aangw dír munguii'ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
