              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Umuú gár naa kuungá' bawi ti harmagahhe' kawa tlehha' ar ilakaahara, ala ma gaa doogara', laqaá ma /aaresara' baraá hara'ayaarihe.»",
          "type": "text",
